Scope

The MIT license above covers the source code, documentation and integrations in
this repository. Two groups of files are licensed differently; REUSE.toml maps
every path to its license and LICENSES/ holds the full texts:

- Example assets (gargoyle, cacador, the crates, gas lamp and training dummy
  props, the humanoid template and the gothic/props palettes) are dedicated to
  the public domain under CC0 1.0 (LICENSES/CC0-1.0.txt).
- Showcase assets (the Templar and Huntress characters from the game Hunt
  Tower, with the Huntress's mine: specs, splash arts, palettes, renders and
  game captures) are
  Copyright (c) 2026 Lucas Ramos / PlayRPG, all rights reserved. They are
  included for demonstration only and are NOT licensed for reuse
  (LICENSES/LicenseRef-Showcase.txt).
